FORM K-1.
IN THE MATTER OF: deposing-the-statutes-of-arithmetic.
INCORPORATE BY REFERENCE statutes-of-arithmetic.

ARTICLE 1.
    PROCLAIM THE FINDING OF absolute-value REGARDING 0 LESS 7.
    PROCLAIM THE FINDING OF maximum REGARDING 3 AND 9.
    PROCLAIM THE FINDING OF minimum REGARDING 3 AND 9.
    PROCLAIM THE FINDING OF signum REGARDING 0 LESS 5.
    PROCLAIM THE FINDING OF power REGARDING 2 AND 10.
    PROCLAIM THE FINDING OF greatest-common-divisor REGARDING 48 AND 36.
    PROCLAIM THE FINDING OF greatest-common-divisor REGARDING 0 LESS 4 AND 6.
    ADJOURN INDEFINITELY.
